**Want a better deal?** You can easily negotiate the price, rights, and terms of any exclusive beat in 3 simple rounds built for artists like you. **STEP 1: START NEGOTIATION** Buyer can negotiate exclusive licenses only. By clicking on negotiate, one can easily start negotiating.

![Want a better deal? You can easily negotiate the price, rights, and terms of any exclusive beat in 3 simple](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-134130.png)

**STEP 2: PROVIDE NEGOTIABLE TERMS** Provide the license fee, master, and publishing rights to proceed. A maximum of three negotiation rounds is allowed.

![STEP 2: PROVIDE NEGOTIABLE TERMS Provide the license fee, master, and publishing rights to proceed. A maximum](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-134141.png)

**STEP 3: LOCK THE DEAL** After finalizing the deal and accepting the offer from the producer, the buyer has 24 hours to complete the purchase.

![STEP 3: LOCK THE DEAL After finalizing the deal and accepting the offer from the producer, the buyer has 24](/images/2025/07/Screenshot-2025-07-01-134232.png)
